     * Compare {@code fromVersion} and {@code toVersion}.
     *
     * <p>The method validates that both version strings are non‑null, contain exactly three
     * dot‑separated numeric components, and that each component can be parsed as an
     * integer. If any of these conditions fail, an {@link IllegalArgumentException}
     * is thrown. The comparison follows the natural ordering of semantic versions:
