/**
 * A custom codec that safely deserializes JSON arrays into Java arrays.
 *
 * <p>This implementation mitigates deserialization attacks by enforcing a strict whitelist
 * of allowable component types. Any attempt to deserialize an array whose component type
 * is not explicitly permitted results in an {@link IllegalArgumentException}. The whitelist
 * covers primitive types, common Java core classes, and selected utility classes that are
 * considered safe for deserialization.</p>
