     *
     * <p>The method performs the following steps:</p>
     * <ul>
     *   <li>Handles {@code null} values.</li>
     *   <li>Converts JSON string literals to {@code byte[]}.</li>
     *   <li>Determines the component class of the target array.</li>
     *   <li>Validates the component class against a whitelist.</li>
     *   <li>Parses the JSON array into a {@link JSONArray}.</li>
     *   <li>Converts the {@link JSONArray} into a typed Java array.</li>
     * </ul>
